  "tagline": "Is the cognitive family of the cell present and answering? One honest check, with a versioned JSON.",
  "description": "HYDRA-UMC-COGNITIVE-NODE is the integration point of the Hailo-10 cognitive family: VLA-ENGINE, VOICE-UI, SEMANTIC-PLANNER and DOCS-QA. Today its real job is to read the manifest of each child, check the shared model-weights folder and, when asked, probe each child over HTTP, and to report that as a versioned JSON on the command line and over a read-only HTTP surface.",
